flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User opens Overstock web app]
    B --> C[User views processing dashboard]
    C --> D[User selects a process step]
    D --> E{Which step?}

    E -->|Step 01| F[Upload inquiry file]
    E -->|SQL / summary step| I[Click process action]

    F --> J[User submits selected file]
    I --> N[User waits for result]

    J --> K{File selected and supported?}
    K -->|No| L[User sees validation error message]
    L --> M[User corrects file choice and retries]
    M --> D
    K -->|Yes| N[User waits for result]

    N --> T[Processing resumes]

    T --> U{Did processing succeed?}
    U -->|Yes| V[User sees success message and updated status]
    U -->|No| W[User sees failure message]

    V --> X{Is an output file available?}
    X -->|Yes| Y[User downloads generated output file]
    X -->|No| Z[User returns to dashboard for next step]
    Y --> Z

    W --> AA{Retry or adjust input?}
    AA -->|Retry| D
    AA -->|Stop| AB([End])
    Z --> AB
